1
00:02:20,566 --> 00:02:23,665
<v Receptionist>Good morning. Sunset Hotel. How may I help you?

2
00:02:23,655 --> 00:02:27,919
<v Customer>Good morning. I just saw an advert in the paper about your hotel. 

3
00:02:27,919 --> 00:02:29,935
<v Customer>Where exactly is it located?

4
00:02:29,935 --> 00:02:34,439
<v Receptionist>We are situated on Sunset Avenue, north of the beach.

5
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:40,477
<v Receptionist>Close to many scenic spots, it is an ideal choice for travellers interested in sightseeing.


6
00:02:40,477 --> 00:02:44,488
<v Customer>That’s great. Is there a vacant four-bed room? 

7
00:02:44,488 --> 00:02:51,816
<v Customer>We’ll be travelling with our two sons aged 9 and 11, so it’s best that we are able to stay in one room.


8
00:02:51,806 --> 00:03:00,581
<v Receptionist>Let me check, just a moment...Um. we only have a few four-bed rooms, and I’m afraid they are fully booked at the moment.

9
00:03:00,571 --> 00:03:09,074
<v Receptionist>The earliest time available is August, but there might be some left in July if a previous customer cancels the reservation.


10
00:03:09,074 --> 00:03:12,419
<v Customer>Oh, that’ll do. How much would the room cost me?


11
00:03:12,419 --> 00:03:20,400
<v Receptionist>It’s 77.50 euros during peak time, but the price would be much lower during off-peak season.

12
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,275
<v Receptionist>Only 50 euros.


13
00:03:22,275 --> 00:03:26,115
<v Customer>So if I book a room right now, is there any discount?

14
00:03:26,115 --> 00:03:34,418
<v Receptionist>Yes. We do offer a 30% discount for any reservation made one month ahead of schedule. It is a very reasonable price.

15
00:03:34,418 --> 00:03:38,122
<v Customer>That does sound tempting. Does the price include anything?


16
00:03:38,122 --> 00:03:42,442
<v Receptionist>The price includes two breakfast vouchers per room per day.

17
00:03:42,442 --> 00:03:46,278
<v Receptionist>You can use them at two different restaurants in our hotel.

18
00:03:46,278 --> 00:03:54,651
<v Receptionist>There’s also a 20-minute spa trial available, but you have to book it beforehand at the concierge or directly at the Spa Centre.


19
00:03:54,651 --> 00:03:59,109
<v Customer>Um, I’m wondering if there is a hairdryer in the room. 

20
00:03:59,109 --> 00:04:02,964
<v Customer>It takes ages to dry my hair without one. Do I have to bring one?


21
00:04:02,964 --> 00:04:09,335
<v Receptionist> No, there is absolutely no need to bring that for each room is equipped with a hairdryer. 

22
00:04:09,335 --> 00:04:13,528
<v Receptionist>But I have to inform you that towels are not provided.

23
00:04:13,528 --> 00:04:17,056
<v Receptionist>You’ll have to bring your own or hire some at the front desk.


24
00:04:17,056 --> 00:04:18,098
<v Customer>Oh, I see.


25
00:04:55,706 --> 00:05:00,013
<v Customer>Before making a reservation, can you tell me a little bit more about your hotel?


26
00:05:00,013 --> 00:05:09,712
<v Receptionist> Sure, no problem. We aim to please our guests by providing impeccable service and all the modem amenities, trying to make them feel at home.


27
00:05:09,712 --> 00:05:19,453
<v Receptionist>In the lounge, there are a list of books, ranging from contemporary literature to classic poetry, free for any guest to read.

28
00:05:19,453 --> 00:05:28,919
<v Receptionist>There is also a games room offering a number of indoor games including popular board games like Monopoly as well as the beloved Table Soccer.

29
00:05:28,919 --> 00:05:31,511
 <v Receptionist>A nice place to go to on rainy days.


30
00:05:31,511 --> 00:05:34,158
<v Customer>Are there computers available in the hotel? 

31
00:05:34,158 --> 00:05:37,882
<v Customer>1 might have a few emails to respond to during my stay there.


32
00:05:37,882 --> 00:05:41,370
<v Receptionist> I’m afraid we currently co not provide any for our customers.

33
00:05:41,370 --> 00:05:44,533
<v Receptionist>However, Internet is available within our hotel premises. 

34
00:05:44,533 --> 00:05:47,555
 <v Receptionist>Just use the room number and guest name to log in.


35
00:05:47,545 --> 00:05:50,628
<v Customer>That means I have to bring my own laptop then. All right.

36
00:05:50,628 --> 00:05:56,803
<v Customer>Um, because I’m travelling with my two sons, is there anything that they might be interested in?


37
00:05:56,803 --> 00:06:00,927
<v Receptionist> Yes, a popular activity here for children is collecting shells on the beach.

38
00:06:00,927 --> 00:06:13,488
<v Receptionist>Our hotel has a private beach. When there are very few visitors, you can take a stroll down the beach with your children and enjoy some quality family time undisturbed.


39
00:06:13,488 --> 00:06:16,112
<v Customer>That sounds nice, but you see my boys really love adventure. 

40
00:06:16,968 --> 00:06:19,752
<v Customer>Is there something more exciting for them to participate in?


41
00:06:19,752 --> 00:06:21,891
<v Receptionist> We do have bicycles ready for hire. 

42
00:06:21,881 --> 00:06:28,955
<v Receptionist>You can cycle with the boys along the bush track by the hotel, which is an ideal place to explore the wonders of nature.

43
00:06:28,955 --> 00:06:35,317
<v Receptionist>But, because there's only a limited number of bicycles, we apply a "first come first serve" rule.


44
00:06:35,317 --> 00:06:37,817
<v Customer>Got it. I think my boys would love it.

45
00:06:37,817 --> 00:06:41,860
<v Customer>How can arrange the payment, then? Can I pay by credit card?


46
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:43,948
<v Receptionist> Of course. We take credit cards. 


47
00:06:43,948 --> 00:06:46,234
<v Customer>Thank you. You've been a great help. 

48
00:06:46,234 --> 00:06:48,081
<v Receptionist>My pleasure, ma'am.